  "name": "Sword Sage's Aegis (Sword Mage)",
  "type": "feat",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>When you use your Arcane Aegis to protect an ally, you can choose up to three creatures to gain its benefits. (You are a valid target as well).</p><p>Additionally, when you have no Reaction remaining and a creature triggers the Reaction attack from your Arcane Aegis feature, you can spend 2 sorcery points to use the attack without a Reaction. You can do so only once per turn.</p>",
